Action: list_files
Action Input: {"path": "/Users/n0w0f/chained_ml_gpt_react_nitride/prepare_ml_ready_dataset_trial_7/nitride_ml_dataset", "recursive": true}

Thought: I have located the necessary files: `test.csv` for the test data and `train.csv` for the training data. Now, I will proceed to evaluate the XGBoost model using the test data to obtain the test set evaluation metrics.
Action: evaluate_xgboost_model
